[
    {
        "content": "<p>Hi!<br>\nMy name is Gianluca Redondi, postdoc at FBK, and I work on invariant synthesis for<br>\nparameterized systems.<br>\nI've built a model checker and I am extending it to<br>\ngenerate Veil modules mechanically in case of a successful proof.</p>\n<p>Input models are similar to Ivy but can also use other SMT theories.<br>\nIf I have Int in the models, Veil still works, but I have troubles in using Reals.</p>\n<p>What I see on <code>veil-2.0-preview</code> (@ <code>2ccca695</code>) is that <code>Real</code> isn't in scope from<br>\n<code>import Veil</code>, and adding <code>import Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic</code> doesn't help either —<br>\nthat olean isn't built in the checkout.</p>\n<p>What made me think this might be close to reachable is that<br>\n<code>verse-lab/lean-smt @ v4.28.0-for-veil-experimental</code>, which this branch depends on,<br>\nalready ships <code>Smt/Translate/Real.lean</code>, mapping Lean <code>Real</code> to SMT-LIB <code>Real</code><br>\ntogether with the arithmetic operators and the <code>Int</code>/<code>Nat</code> casts.</p>\n<p>So my question: is it conceivable to declare real-sorted state components, e.g.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">individual</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">clock</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Real</span>\n<span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">deadline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Real</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>or is there something that rules it out?</p>\n<p>I have several benchmarks with reals I can share if that can help.</p>\n<p>Thanks,<br>\nGianluca</p>",
        "id": 615834828,
        "sender_full_name": "Gianluca Redondi",
        "timestamp": 1786449779
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"1185520\">@Gianluca Redondi</span> Please share a simple benchmark and I’ll be able to take a look.</p>\n<p>We should indeed be able to hook into Lean SMT’s handling of Reals.</p>",
        "id": 615835598,
        "sender_full_name": "George Pîrlea",
        "timestamp": 1786450003
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>You of course wouldn’t be able to use the explicit state model checker, but <code>#check_invariants</code> and <code>sat trace</code> / <code>unsat trace</code> might work.</p>",
        "id": 615835776,
        "sender_full_name": "George Pîrlea",
        "timestamp": 1786450067
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>here is a very simple benchmark: </p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Veil</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">veil</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">module</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TimedRoutes</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">route</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">relation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsActive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">route</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bool</span>\n<span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TimeLeft</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">route</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Real</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">gen_state</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">after_init</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">IsActive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">TimeLeft</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n<span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- a route is activated with a strictly positive countdown</span>\n<span class=\"n\">transition</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">activate</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">route</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Real</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsActive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsActive'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↔</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∨</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsActive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"o\">))</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TimeLeft'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≠</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TimeLeft'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TimeLeft</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- Time elapses by `delta`. A route survives the step only if it is active and</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">-- still has strictly more than `delta` left, and then its countdown decreases;</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">-- a route whose remaining time is at most `delta` is released.</span>\n<span class=\"n\">transition</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">elapse</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">delta</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Real</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">delta</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsActive'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↔</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">IsActive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">delta</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TimeLeft</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"o\">))</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">IsActive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">delta</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TimeLeft</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TimeLeft'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TimeLeft</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">delta</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">IsActive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">delta</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TimeLeft</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TimeLeft'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TimeLeft</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">safety</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">no_overrun</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsActive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TimeLeft</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">gen_spec</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">check_invariants</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TimedRoutes</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 616107861,
        "sender_full_name": "Gianluca Redondi",
        "timestamp": 1786545762
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Thanks. It will take me a few days until I get the chance to try to make this work. I'll get back to you once I do.</p>",
